		(property "Description" "RJ45 Ethernet jack with integrated magnetics and status LEDs (HanRun HR911105A, LCSC C12074). Symbol redrawn to match the previous RJ45-HANRUN layout for drop-in rewiring; pin numbers map to the HR911105A_TH through-hole footprint (1-12 + SH1/SH2). Pins 4/5 are the TX/RX center taps; pins 7/8 are the magnetics termination / chassis pins - verify against the HR911105A datasheet before finalizing."
